  h1="About Vierdaagse Logeren"
>
  <p>
    Vierdaagse Logeren is an independent platform that helps walkers and visitors find
    a place to stay in time during the Nijmegen Four Days Marches. We are not
    affiliated with Stichting De Vierdaagse (DE4D), the municipality of Nijmegen, or any
    official organisation behind the event.
  </p>

  <h2>Why we do this</h2>
  <p>
    Every year thousands of people look for a place to sleep during the Four Days
    Marches, and supply is limited. We gather practical information about camping,
    private stays, and hotels, so you don't have to keep ten tabs open yourself.
  </p>

  <h2>Independence</h2>
  <p>
    We are not part of the event's organisation. We refer visitors to existing
    providers (campsites, hotels, private hosts) and may receive a small commission via
    affiliate links — this does not affect our recommendations.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions or feedback? Get in touch via our <a href="/en/contact">contact form</a>, or email us directly at <a href="mailto:contact@vierdaagselogeren.nl">contact@vierdaagselogeren.nl</a>.</p>
</ContentPage>
